  "steps": [
   "Cook the onion, garlic, ají pastes and tomato in the oil for 10 minutes.",
   "Add the wine and reduce 3 minutes. Add the stock and crabs and boil 10 minutes.",
   "Add the mussels, cover and cook 4 minutes, until they open. Discard any that stay shut.",
   "Add the fish and squid, 3 minutes. Add the shrimp, 2 minutes.",
   "Add the salt, turn off and serve with cilantro and lime."
  ],
  "tips": [
   "The crabs go first because they flavour the broth.",
   "Traditionally it uses chicha de jora instead of wine."
